A stack of throwing daggers.  If you're in the mines, more will show up 
soon.  Go ahead and use Sting; it's no worse than an ordinary dagger.
When you are forced to melee (which will happen when you only have 3/4 
daggers to throw), it might be worth practicing twoweaponing.  I expect 
that the to-hit penalty outweighs the extra damage, but try it (in safe 
circumstances).

Remember that you should throw daggers even at close range.

Really, the to-hit bonus of daggers usually makes them better than other 
weapons in the early game.

